{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98244","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98244/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98244/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98244/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/98244","id":2592672906,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc6aiQyK","number":98244,"title":"GDScript suggests closing curly brace when comma is missing in dictionary","user":{"login":"Medie1","id":80110266,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgwMTEwMjY2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/80110266?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Medie1","html_url":"https://github.com/Medie1","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Medie1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Medie1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Medie1/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Medie1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Medie1/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Medie1/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Medie1/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Medie1/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Medie1/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":279097162,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTcxNjI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/discussion","name":"discussion","color":"ccaaff","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098082,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwODI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdscript","name":"topic:gdscript","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":4,"created_at":"2024-10-16T18:10:15Z","updated_at":"2024-10-16T21:19:11Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproducible in 4.3.stable.arch_linux\n\n### System information\n\nArch Linux, Vulkan 1.3.280 - Forward+, NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1080 Ti\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen forgetting to add a comma after a dictionary entry, the engine will give an error saying: \r\n> \"Expected closing \"}\" after dictionary elements.\"\r\n\r\nIt wrongfully presumes the developer forgot to add a closing bracket, while the developer actually forgot to add a comma.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nJust create a dictionary with atleast 2 entries and don't add a trailing comma after an entry. Using GDScript.\r\n\r\n```gdscript\r\nvar ExampleDictionary = {\r\n        \"Key1\": \"Value1\" # <- There should be a comma here\r\n        \"Key2\": \"Value2\" # <- Here as well\r\n}\r\n```\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nJust a new project.","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98244/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98244/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}